        "builtin": "action"
      },
      "description": "github.push fast-forwards the PR head branch to the approved commit from the pr-fix run's bundle, only on a passing gate and only while every rule of the chain is enabled. It verifies the WHOLE chain from the store: this run was started by a trusted review-commit run's success, that one by a trusted pr-fix run's, the commit and its start, bundle and PR are what that fix run's last gate built, and that review run's record approves exactly this commit by a reviewer other than the implementer. Runs on spark2, where the bundle is.",
